    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bl\u00eaktre 2081 is a real-life simulator designed to be unfair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a penniless migrant. <strong>Beg, steal, or beat up the poor</strong> to serve the higher interests of society\u00a9\u00ae. Climb the ranks: <strong>invest</strong>, grow your businesses, and <strong>ride the snowball effect where money attracts more money</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vision of a decaying world, happiness is measured by owning a state-of-the-art portable air conditioner. Build your home, your businesses, your prestige, and your fortune until you become the mayor of the city and enforce your own laws. <strong>In Bl\u00eaktre 2081, every role \u2014 mayor, police officer, dealer, DJ, shopkeeper\u2026 \u2014 is permanently held by a player until replaced by another</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire city operates as a living organism where every player is a vital cog in the machine, and it is this <strong>radical design that makes the game fundamentally unfair</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives access to the full game, but without a visa. If the current player-mayor decides to make the visa-less illegal, player-police officers will be able to arrest you. Escape them, prosper anyway, and one day take their place to change the laws in your favor !</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bl\u00eaktre 2081 is a real-life simulator designed to be unfair.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a penniless migrant. <strong>Beg, steal, or beat up the poor</strong> to serve the higher interests of society\u00a9\u00ae. Climb the ranks: <strong>invest</strong>, grow your businesses, and <strong>ride the snowball effect where money attracts more money</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vision of a decaying world, happiness is measured by owning a state-of-the-art portable air conditioner. Build your home, your businesses, your prestige, and your fortune until you become the mayor of the city and enforce your own laws. <strong>In Bl\u00eaktre 2081, every role \u2014 mayor, police officer, dealer, DJ, shopkeeper\u2026 \u2014 is permanently held by a player until replaced by another</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire city operates as a living organism where every player is a vital cog in the machine, and it is this <strong>radical design that makes the game fundamentally unfair</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo gives access to the full game, but without a visa. If the current player-mayor decides to make the visa-less illegal, player-police officers will be able to arrest you. Escape them, prosper anyway, and one day take their place to change the laws in your favor !</p>",
